Third-party components
----------------------
Linux agent (Python):
  - websockets (BSD-3-Clause) - https://github.com/python-websockets/websockets
  - dbus-python, optional (MIT) - https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/dbus/dbus-python

Map dashboard (loaded by the browser from a CDN, not redistributed):
  - Leaflet 1.9.4 (BSD-2-Clause) - https://leafletjs.com
  - Map tiles: OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL), CARTO basemaps

Android app:
  - AndroidX Core, AppCompat, Lifecycle, ConstraintLayout, RecyclerView (Apache-2.0)
  - Material Components for Android (Apache-2.0)
  - Kotlin standard library and kotlinx.coroutines (Apache-2.0)
  - OkHttp / Okio (Apache-2.0)

Test-only dependencies (not shipped): JUnit 4 (EPL-1.0), org.json (Public Domain / JSON License).
